# Shared by both images. The build context is the repository root for either
# one, because resolving a single workspace package needs the whole workspace.
#
# `repos/` matters most: two vendored monorepos are the bulk of this checkout
# and no image needs a byte of them.
repos/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.output/
**/.tanstack/
**/.tsbuildinfo/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.direnv/
.env
.env.local
knowledge/
*.md
!AGENTS.md
